// CreateDomainWithBody Add a domain (staged until deployed)
//
// Hostnames are RFC 1123, lowercase and globally unique. A hostname that is taken, or lies in a Cloudflare zone another team connected, answers 409 `domain_conflict` ("the hostname is not available"): the answer never says which, or whose. Fails with 422 `proxy_unavailable` while the server's proxy is not running. `statusMessage` carries DNS guidance and `dnsOk` the result of the periodic DNS check. Compose stacks need `component` (422 `component_required`, `unknown_component`) and, unless the component declares exactly one port, `targetPort` (422 `target_port_required`). A service with several processes routes a domain to one process, named in `process`: the default process when it has a port, else the only process with one (422 `process_required` when several have a port, `unknown_process`, `process_has_no_port`, `invalid_target_port`); `process` on a service without processes is 422 `invalid_process`.
