	//
	// Instance administrator only. `quotaBytes` null resets the team to the instance default. Only the S3 slice has a quota (422 `quota_not_supported`). Lowering it below use only blocks new backups; existing backups are never deleted to make room. Audited.
	//
	// Takes a body of the `application/json` content type, and returns a wrapper object for the known response body format(s).
