	//
	// Instance administrator only. Deletes the bucket, its key, the registry images and the logs of a team that was deleted, instead of waiting for the 30 days. `confirm` is the team's name. 409 `team_still_exists` while the team exists, 404 when it has no slices left, 422 `confirmation_mismatch`. Audited.
