// CheckRegistryWithResponse Test a registry from a server
//
// The agent on the chosen server contacts the registry with the stored credentials and reports whether push and pull are accepted. Waits up to 25 seconds; if the agent has not answered by then the response has `pending: true` and the result appears in the registry's `lastCheck`.
